本兼容入口","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-thm-fhodtt-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"7b655ef4974b8266","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-thm-fhodtt-soundness]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-fhodtt-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"7b655ef4974b8266","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Type}$，演算、带注释表达式集 $\\mathsf{Expr}$、严格模型谓词 $\\mathrm{SplitFHoDTTModel}$ 与 $\\models^{\\mathrm{spl}}$ 全部采用 [[16-thm-fhodtt-soundness]] 的已定义接口。模型量词使用该页的同一严格记录论域。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Type}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Expr}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SplitFHoDTTModel}","display":false},{"tex":"\\models^{\\mathrm{spl}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigl[(\\exists e\\in\\mathsf{Expr})\\ \\Gamma\\vdash e:A\\bigr]\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl[(\\forall S)\\bigl(\\mathrm{SplitFHoDTTModel}(S)\\Longrightarrow\nS\\models^{\\mathrm{spl}}_\\Gamma A\\bigr)\\bigr].","display":true}],"bytes":1560,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-422","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-thm-fhodtt-soundness-compat|thm-fhodtt-soundness — Compatibility statement]]"}],"outgoing":["7b655ef4974b8266"]}